#
# Carries the placeholder __E_STAR__ so it cannot be applied thoughtlessly:
# unreplaced, it does not compile. Choose E* by docs/RELANCA-G4-DIAS-DE-BANDEIRA.md
# §2.2 (re-measure t_replay first), check §2.3 (strictly future AT TAG TIME) and
# §2.6 (E* > 1400), then:
#
#   E=<chosen epoch>
#   sed "s/__E_STAR__/$E/g" docs/RELANCA-G4-DIAS-DE-BANDEIRA.activation.patch | git apply
#   cargo test -p bloch-pos-committee --lib
#
# The suite then pins $E (the inert tripwire is replaced by the armed one and
# by the shared-flag-day test of §2.5). Fill the §9 table in the same commit.
#
